# The image copies an explicit file list, so nothing below can reach it. This is about the build
# *context*: without it, `docker build .` uploads the virtualenv, the git history, every cache and
# the raw GLEIF payloads under data/ to the builder on every run — and it removes the safety margin
# that the explicit COPY list is providing.
.git
.github
.venv
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.env
data
docs
tests
scripts
*.md
!README.md
